  "title": "Gingerbread Scones with Lemon Breakfast Cream",
  "description": "Plenty of spices and a touch of molasses make these oatmeal gingerbread scones topped with a creamy lemon sauce a yummy breakfast or brunch choice.",
  "authors": [
